+## Left by 03
+
+- A change keeps the replaced mesocycle's `accepted_after` and stores `cycles` as the cycles done plus the agent's cycles left (`mesocycles.record_mesocycle(changing=...)`). Its last cycle is the end of the whole count, and what was performed against it starts at `accepted_after`, which can predate its `accepted_on`.
